# Hydrology_Road_Combined_Proximity
# Computes a weighted average of horizontal distances to hydrology and roadways, emphasizing proximity to critical environmental features.
# Usefulness: Combines proximity to water and roads into a single measure, acknowledging the ecological impact of both features.
